      "message": "You mean like below?\n\n```\n    @VisibleForTesting\n    public BpfNetMaps(final INetd netd, final Dependencies deps) {\n        ensureInitialized();\n        mNetd \u003d netd;\n        mConfigurationMap \u003d deps.getConfigurationMap();\n    }\n```\n\nI thought, some/all steps in native_init also could use Java BPF map and, at that time, tests may want to inject dependencies to initialization.\nSo, I passed dependencies to initialization.\n\nHow about below to allow test to initialize multiple times if tests wants?\n\n``` \n    // Only tests or ensureInitialized in this class can call this.\n    @VisibleForTesting\n    public static void initialize(final Dependencies deps) {\n         if (!USE_NETD) {\n           System.loadLibrary(\"service-connectivity\");\n           native_init();\n           sConfigurationMap \u003d deps.getConfigurationMap(); \n         }\n    }\n    \n    private static synchronized void ensureInitialized() {\n        if (sInitialized) return;\n        initialize(new Dependencies());\n        sInitialized \u003d true;\n    }    \n    \n    public BpfNetMaps(final INetd netd) {\n        this(netd);\n    }\n    \n```",
